    {"kind":"function","quote":"The condition monitoring server analyses vibration spectra"},
    {"kind":"function","quote":"raises a warning at least 14 days before predicted failure"},
    {"kind":"system_element","quote":"The server is hosted by the operator's IT department in a private cloud"},
    {"kind":"assumption","quote":"Offshore weather windows for maintenance are assumed to be available about 60 percent of the time"}
